# UI/UX Skill (EAES)

For layout, visual design, components, interaction patterns, or UX review in matched files:

1. Read `AGENTS.md` (UI/UX section).
2. Consult `.codex/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/SKILL.md` first as the UI/UX routing entrypoint.
3. Use the relevant specialized skill under `.codex/skills/` when needed: `ui-styling`, `design`, `design-system`, `brand`, `slides`, or `banner-design`.
4. Search scripts live at `.codex/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py`; upstream source data remains under `.agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max-skill/`.

The skill supports design quality only; it does not override `PRD_V1.md` or expand scope beyond the audit.
